Good Morning!

Happy Mother's Day to all of our mothers, wives and daughters in Fun Stuff =
Joke List(tm) land!!  We hope you all have a GREAT day today.

I am pleased to report that my prior profession has finally received some w=
ell deserved recognition:

[cid:image015.png@01D85FB1.D2C6BE80]


Our jokes today, stolen as usual, are dedicated to the families and friends=
 of all of the recent graduates.  Thanks for all you have done for them.

Keep smiling...........................ss

***************************************************************************=
******************************

A Joke A Day:

A career Army officer I once met was jumpmaster for his unit and was taking=
 up a few novices for a drop. The flight was pretty rough, and after a whil=
e, the jumpmaster called off the jump because of high winds. As the plane h=
eaded back to base, and the pilot pulled off an unusually smooth landing, t=
wo of the neophytes got airsick.

"How come you could take that rough flight, but you couldn't handle the smo=
oth landing?" asked the jumpmaster.

"Well, sir," one trainee explained, "We've always jumped out of planes. We'=
ve never actually landed before."



